@ParkingSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "izza@gmail.com", 
    "password": "Test123"
}

###
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@gmail.com", 
    "password": "Admin123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@gmail.com",
    "password": "Admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Check availability
GET {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/availability
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Issue Ticket
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "vehicleNumber": "Leb-870",
  "vehicleType": "Car"
}

### 2.1 Issue Ticket
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "vehicleNumber": "ABC-123",
  "vehicleType": "Car"
}

### 3. Calculate Exit Fee
PATCH {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets/22/exit
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.1 Calculate Exit Fee
PATCH {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets/22/exit
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Record Payment
POST {{ParkingSystem_HostAddress}}/api/parking/tickets/22/pay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ 
    "paymentMethod": "Cash" 
}